                        </span>
                        <ul class="hc-badges">
                            <li><img src="https://cdn.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/wp-content/plugins/home-crowd/images/member.svg" width="16" height="16" alt="Fantasy Football Scout Member" class="hc-title" title="Fantasy Football Scout Member"></li><li><img src="https://cdn.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/wp-content/plugins/home-crowd/images/anniversary_15.svg" width="16" height="16" alt="17 Years" class="hc-title" title="17 Years"></li></ul><span class="hc-date hc-title" title="18th Aug 2026 15:33">14 hours, 29 mins ago</span></div><p class="hc-comment-text">Don&#039;t mean to push back with a question (you are a much better FPL manager than I am), but how often will you captain Bruno?  That MF and DEF seems weak with 6 players that are questionable: Jac Shaw Davis Tzo Ndo Gross.  Downgrading Bruno could give you any combo of reliability in Szobo, Wirtz, Palmer, MGW, Semenyo (and I&#039;m avoiding saying Foden in that list as I said reliable).<br><br>I guess you will always sit Shaw and Davis, so then one of those 3 MFs gets benched each week.<br><br>Good luck!</p></div></div><div class="actions-wrapper"><div class="hc-open-tools"><span class="icon-kebab"></span> <span class="nonvis">Open Controls</span></a></div><ul class="hc-comment-actions mob-hidden"><li class="hc-permalink hc-title"><a href="https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/2026/08/18/why-fpl-managers-shouldnt-obsess-over-ownership-figures?hc_page=-1#hc_comment_27681184" class="hc-title" title="Permalink"><span class="icon-permalink"></span> <span class="nonvis">Permalink</span></a></li></ul><div class="hc-login-to-reply"><a href="/wp-login.php?redirect_to=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk%2F2026%2F08%2F18%2Fwhy-fpl-managers-shouldnt-obsess-over-ownership-figures">Login To Reply</a></div></div></div></li></ol></li><li class="hc-comment-wrapper hc-level-0">
