			</p><p class="login-remember"><label><input name="rememberme" type="checkbox" id="rememberme_modal" value="forever" /> Remember Me</label></p><p class="login-submit">
				<input type="submit" name="wp-submit" id="wp-submit_modal" class="button button-primary" value="Sign In" />
				<input type="hidden" name="redirect_to" value="https://www.fantasyfootballscout.co.uk/2026/08/18/why-fpl-managers-shouldnt-obsess-over-ownership-figures" />
			</p></form>        
